cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the AIDOC-AP LEX Extension, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AIDOC-AP LEX Extension: Legal and Ethical Requirements"
version: "1.0"
abstract: >-
  Extension module of the AIDOC-AP application profile for legal and ethical requirements. It adds
  the terms needed to document how an AI system meets the obligations of providers and deployers
  in Articles 9 to 17, 72 and 73 of the EU AI Act and the ethical requirements of ALTAI, the OECD
  AI Principles and the gender requirements of CERTAIN D3.2. The requirements, their competency
  questions and the expected evidence are published with the module. The module imports the core
  without changing it.
